<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of weekend matches</p>
<p>in the Argentine Apertura soccer championship.</p>
<p> Boca Juniors	     0    Independiente		1</p>
<p> Colon			1    Huracan-Corrientes	 1</p>
<p> Deportivo Espanol	1    Gimnasia-La Plata	  2</p>
<p> Estudiantes		0    River Plate		  1</p>
<p> Gimnasia-Jujuy	   2    Ferro Carril Oeste	 2</p>
<p> Huracan		    3    Union			  0</p>
<p> Lanus			3    San Lorenzo		  1</p>
<p> Platense		   4    Velez Sarsfield	    4</p>
